{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":389486,\"title\":\"One Night\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"On her way home one night, a young working girl who lives alone with her mother is asked to go sleep at her friend's house. She wanders all night in Teheran and meets three men who have different stories.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2lKFw4n8YjFPiTwjKiOfIVD0ry.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":4.4,\"voteCount\":9,\"year\":2005,\"runtime\":78,\"genres\":[],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IR\",\"name\":\"Iran\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Niki Karimi\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":545088,\"name\":\"Niki Karimi\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/26UqVrs5GAaEvTo6PtHoABwGRGN.jpg\"},{\"id\":1007455,\"name\":\"Hanie Tavassoli\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/veuWD6UZz7IZwe5fVl6zLfuFZil.jpg\"},{\"id\":1350953,\"name\":\"Saeed Ebrahimifar\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tcJZb86XVHtNTE6fjZneZBP77FG.jpg\"},{\"id\":3978079,\"name\":\"Abdolreza Fakhar\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3978080,\"name\":\"Nader Torkaman\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":268660,\"title\":\"Bangalore Days\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iFMyZw1DTGvZ8hPa0eTseSFiRT1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/VmVJtd0hhQ7NpH3lykSv40Udic.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fun roller coaster ride about three young people, Aju, Divya and Kuttan who are cousins, reach Bangalore to dream, discover & explore!\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456574,\"title\":\"Solitaire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/67FMvx4tmAHmm99fE0lEtqn0Van.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kZ8qv9fG97zuW5YDusrbJFFs0ob.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Therese, the mayor's wife in a Lebanese village, joyfully prepares for an overnight visit of her daughter's suitor and his parents. She excitedly shares the happy news of the engagement with pictures of her beloved brother who was killed by a Syrian bomb 20 years ago and is still bizarrely present in every corner of her house. Only when the long-awaited guests are at her doorstep, she discovers they are Syrian; this engagement will only happen over Therese's dead body!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1382,\"title\":\"Me and You and Everyone We Know\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hrj9VsInHnqSDBhEc2FvY0qd79F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j3moxxL3MBkJhp0imy4v1QxALwi.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Single dad Richard meets Christine, a starving artist who moonlights as a cabbie. They awkwardly attempt to start a romance, but Richard’s divorce has left him emotionally damaged. Meanwhile, Richard’s sons—one a teenager, the other 6-years-old—take part in clumsy experiments with the opposite sex.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":457920,\"title\":\"Worst Case, We Get Married\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oxurwUpSvL0kIVubyA0nQUMO56T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uFdLdOW2L3ovVjKNgBD6GxlI8sB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Aïcha is a troubled teenage girl who cannot forgive her mother for kicking out the stepfather she adored. Aïcha longs for him to come back and take her away. When she meets Baz, a man twice her age, it’s love at first sight for her; the real kind, the one that hurts. Baz wants to help this lost little girl, but she wants much more from him, and is ready to do anything to get it.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456946,\"title\":\"The Disinherited\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eFMfEeccyUzyC5ATA98teIOKWAG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Portrait of the director's father facing the end of his family business. Lack of money forces him to drive clients who destroy his vehicle to bachelor parties, but he is not prepared to lose his dignity.\",\"genres\":[],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268375,\"title\":\"Bim Bam Boom, Las Luchas Morenas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yyBLsTz8hD9mQZ2iPaBmbCJrhUR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bim Bam Boom Las Luchas Morenas, is about three Mexican sisters, professional wrestlers, whose lives, lived according to their own ideas, are a struggle but also a lot fun.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268677,\"title\":\"Words with Gods\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zmBmWXDyy54mNpmTWSmUqmJ6EbW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gR7XokQ7uidQtRfoaCmmAodZ9Q0.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The first of four installments in the groundbreaking Heartbeat of the World anthology film series. Comprised of several short films by some of the world's most exciting directors, Words with Gods follows the theme of religion - specifically as it relates to an individual's relationship with his/her god or gods...or the lack thereof.  In Words with Gods, each director recounts a narrative centered around human fragility, as well as environmental and cultural crises involving specific religions with which each has a personal relationship; including early Aboriginal Spirituality, Umbanda, Buddhism, the Abrahamic faiths, Hinduism, and Atheism. An animated sequence by Mexican animator Maribel Martinez is woven through each of the film segments, with each segment narratively connected as a feature-length film.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456538,\"title\":\"The Tank\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/za65aCQQmjWzGxxH7hHH7v7mB4V.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iWIZIrjKu8LsUydPRYw7B7RIQiN.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On April 26, 2012, six people entered an Isolated Confined Environment with the mission to simulate a trip to Mars. Their mission was a catastrophic failure.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456608,\"title\":\"Film Title Poem\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jEfenTBMQuHlrSVun3Puou6rKLj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xGt2OqICxG7NcKtu7J5t57uXfMK.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Film Title Poem is comprised of over 500 film title cards.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1434326,\"title\":\"Street Smart\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Zc9TceMjwkfVv2IkH4BrP5dXmK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ff9TT0KqFENrmOnY0EXDWtdbBAF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look into the lives of a lively group of unhoused young adults in the iconic beach town, who come together with humor and a bit of Robin Hood-style larceny, forging unbreakable bonds and redefining what it means to be a family.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"lxErMisNKBw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"tz-jVdykE50\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"x0WnyntXUZ4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}